{"id":"6b4634c0f149","date":"2026-11-01","stream":"dc","section":"ROW 資料中心動態","title":"Amazon 設備抵押籌 800 億美元","summary":"24/7 Wall St. 報導，Amazon 正以自有資料中心設備作為抵押，借款以支應更多資料中心；Pluang 並稱此為 800 億美元有擔保貸款計畫。這使 AI 資料中心擴張的資金來源，從單純公司債轉向以設備為基礎的融資安排；素材未披露利率與到期結構。","source":"24/7 Wall St.","feed":"AWS Infra","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOQ3FDTU83bk8zYk9rdkRWNnY1SHFrMDdyQTN0V0tJeUd5LWpyb284elA2Znd5SGJaS2Q4SXRQeE9UQWpXMy1KbUZnQmlJODNBckRTaTd5eVJ0VDFzc1hlZ2UyaGtBaEU2UjFFTVpCMUM4WThjRS02amE4b2lENzE1YTBaaEpHLTVBSm90YXk4MFlid2Y0VDVsVjhzSk9FcDJlRWdROFRpS3pRbDkxeEszWEVJN2VIOTBJeUZFS2FrZw?oc=5"}
